  "title": "sharkd: Remove json order restriction",
  "description": "The \"method\" root member previously needed to be in front of\nlevel 2 parameters inside of the json string.\n\nThis commit removes the order restriction by first obtaining the\n\"method\" before continuing the normal process of checking/obtaining values.\nA valid json string would now also be:\n`{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\", \"params\":{\"file\":\"info.pcapng\"}, \"id\":1, \"method\":\"load\"}`\n\nCloses #17824",
  "state": "merged",
